# minecraft runtime artifacts — created when NeoForge boots the game
# (runClient / runServer / gameTestServer). Not produced by `:neoforge:test`
# (plain JUnit, no Minecraft boot), but `runClient` / `gameTestServer` both
# write debug.log, latest.log, and crash-reports to a top-level `logs/` /
# `crash-reports/` next to the module. `saves/` is the world directory, and
# `caches/` is NeoForge's resource-cache scratch.
logs
crash-reports
saves
caches

